  "BaseConditions": "Machine Groomed",
  "Report": "<div><em>November 26, 2026 at 5:35 a.m. — </em>Happy Thanksgiving from Solitude! Come feast on some tasty laps before the big meal. Moonbeam Express, Apex Express, Link, and the Magic Carpet are up and running, providing access to 7 trails. More terrain is expected soon! Start your day with the <a href=\"https://www.solitudemountain.com/things-to-do/events-and-activities/thanksgiving-turkey-trot\">Thanksgiving Turkey Trot </a>at 7:00 a.m. followed by our annual T-Day <a href=\"https://www.solitudemountain.com/things-to-do/events-and-activities/thanksgiving-turkey-scavenger-hunt\">scavenger hunt</a> at 9:00 a.m. Keep your eyes open for turkeys (and possibly some treats and prizes) while out skiing and riding. Expect firm conditions on the mountain today. Apex terrain is “experts only” right now. Take extra caution at the top of Apex, especially on the initial descent. Please check your speed and kindly share the mountain with other guests. Terrain park features have been removed from Easy Street. Have a great holiday at Solitude!<br><br></div>",
  "AdditionalText": "November 26, 2026 at 5:35 a.m. — Happy Thanksgiving from Solitude! Come feast on some tasty laps before the big meal. Moonbeam Express, Apex Express, Link, and the Magic Carpet are up and running, providing access to 7 trails. More terrain is expected soon! Start your day with the Thanksgiving Turkey Trot at 7:00 a.m. followed by our annual T-Day scavenger hunt at 9:00 a.m. Keep your eyes open for turkeys (and possibly some treats and prizes) while out skiing and riding. Expect firm conditions on the mountain today. Apex terrain is “experts only” right now. Take extra caution at the top of Apex, especially on the initial descent. Please check your speed and kindly share the mountain with other guests. Terrain park features have been removed from Easy Street. Have a great holiday at Solitude!",
